cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research software or its audit methods, cite this repository and identify the commit used. Cite source datasets and third-party methods separately."
type: software
title: "CASMI26: Molecular Identification Research"
authors:
  - family-names: Cetin
    given-names: Senanur
repository-code: "https://github.com/senanurcetin/enveda-casmi26"
url: "https://github.com/senanurcetin/enveda-casmi26"
abstract: "Noncommercial NEXUS research software for mass-constrained molecular candidate retrieval, evidence-based ranking, chemical-family validation, paired spectral controls, and data provenance audits. Historical competition results, frozen-model diagnostics and fresh supervised internal studies have distinct evidence boundaries."
keywords:
  - tandem mass spectrometry
  - molecular identification
  - candidate ranking
  - reproducible data science
  - leakage audits
